@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### the list and the item use the same Product DTO
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=1

### the item form of the same record
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee

### a created product never exposes tenantId, deletedAt, or storage keys
# @capture createdId = $.id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "LMP-001",
  "slug": "camp-lamp",
  "name": "Camp Lamp",
  "priceCents": 3499,
  "currency": "USD",
  "stock": 12
}

### customer DTO derives status instead of exposing bannedAt logic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/customers/cus_acme_01

### field selection is applied after the DTO is built
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/{{createdId}}?fields=id,name,priceCents
